---
import { DemoRsvp } from '../demo/DemoRsvp'
---
<section id="see-it-live" class="responses-section section-wrap section-space" aria-labelledby="responses-heading">
  <div class="responses-copy" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow">From their invitation to your guest list</p>
    <h2 id="responses-heading" class="display">Every guest.<br />Every celebration.<br /><span>Every reply.</span></h2>
    <p>One household, several celebrations. Guests respond for each person and event, with dietary details kept alongside their replies.</p>
    <dl class="response-benefits">
      <div><dt>Invite the right people to each moment</dt><dd>Keep the ceremony, reception and other events organised separately.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>See who is coming</dt><dd>Bring attendance and dietary notes together in your organiser workspace.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Easy for your guests</dt><dd>A link and a household code. Nothing to download or sign up for.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="demo-note">Try the invitation beside this text. It is an example; nothing you enter is saved.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="responses-demo" data-reveal><DemoRsvp client:visible /><noscript><p class="demo-note">Enable JavaScript to try the RSVP preview.</p></noscript></div>
</section>
